== Bugs ==
*Occasionally, '''Huntraps''' with an [[Attribute Shard]] caught may glitch and display as empty. Picking up such a trap through its menu does not reward the shards caught, resulting in loss of those.
**The shards may be successfully retrieved by clicking on the "your traps caught something!" Game Message, switching lobbies until the issue disappears, or through the {{Item|Hunting Toolkit}} menu if the '''Huntrap''' had previously been added to it.

== Trivia ==
*If a '''Huntrap''' is placed in the [[Crystal Hollows]] and the player switches lobbies, the trap can still be found at the same coordinates, often buried within solid blocks.

